== Trivia ==
* [[wikipedia:Skatole|Skatole]] is a mildly toxic white crystalline organic compound that occurs naturally in feces.
* According to Edmund McMillen's [https://youtu.be/kby0rXT7qYQ First post-Repentance Lore Stream], Skatole's visual was designed first, with McMillen then working backwards to create an appropriate effect to justify an item that puts a poop on Isaac's head.
* Skatole was considered as a cosmetic hat for ''Team Fortress 2'', alongside tears, {{i|Brimstone}}, and {{i|Tiny Planet}}. It was dropped as Valve "... didn't want players running around with a wet piece of poop on their heads."
* {{dlc|r}} This item is used in {{chal|Scat Man|n}}.
* {{dlc|r}} This item is one of the only five ({{dlc|r+}} seven) that count towards 2 transformations ({{tf|Beelzebub}} and {{tf|Oh Crap}}), the other ones being {{i|Magic Mushroom}}, {{i|The Bible}}, {{I|Hive Mind}}, {{i|Parasitoid|n}}, {{dlc|r+}} {{i|The Necronomicon}}, and {{i|Seraphim}}.

